Step of implement spring boot
1. - Entity
  - Create ProductEntity
2. - DTO
  - Create Product Response
  - Create Product Request
3.- Create Mapper
  - Mapper Request to Entity
  - Mapper Entity to Response
4.- Repository
  - Create Method get all product from collections
5.- Service
  - Create Product service -> interface
  - Create Product Service impl from product service
  - Create get all products
6.- Controllers
  - Create Product Controller
  - Method get all products
